* Crypto hacks 2021
** Figures
*** Chainalysis: ~$3.2B stolen, 72% DeFi
*** Immunefi ~$2.33B hacks, CertiK ~$1.3B DeFi
*** SlowMist: ~$2.48B, frauds excluded
*** North Korea: ~$400M in 7 attacks
** Largest incidents
*** Poly Network ~$611M (returned)
*** BitMart, AscendEX, Liquid (hot wallets)
*** Compound ~$80M to ~$147M (upgrade bug)
** DeFi's growth year
*** Cream x3, Alpha Homora, Iron Bank
*** Flash-loan pricing (PancakeBunny, xToken)
*** Math and accounting (Uranium, MonoX, Spartan)
** Keys and supply chain
*** BadgerDAO ~$120M (front-end injection)
*** bZx, EasyFi, Vulcan Forged, BXH
** Frauds and accidents (not counted)
*** Thodex, Africrypt, AnubisDAO
*** Meerkat, Snowdog, Squid Game token
*** Accident: StakeHound ETH lost at Fireblocks (~$75M)
